@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000


### Hello (AppController)
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Lấy tất cả user
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/all

### Lấy user lọc theo name
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/all?name=tien

### Lấy user lọc theo parm
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/ab/99999

### Tạo user
POST {{baseUrl}}/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tien"
}

### Cập nhật user
PUT {{baseUrl}}/user/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tien Updated"
}

### Xóa user
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/user/1
Content-Type: application/json
